GRIG: Thank God you made it back in one piece, sir! We're down to our last walker and we cannot afford to lose that comm tower!

BAKR: Looks like the Soviet assault is being coordinated from a base to the north. If you can knock out their communications it should soften the assault.

SHAW: Thank you, Corporal. Cobra One, I want you to head for that base the moment you see an opening!